{"lines":[{"y":0.087209302447899373,"w":0.017475727399190261,"c":1,"t":"D","x":0.073786408072249537,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"c":1,"y":0.49273255829819007,"x":0.073786408047977675,"w":0.017475727399190261,"t":"G","h":0.01453488311292217},{"w":0.080523033142089862,"x":0.82681049600162526,"y":0.039878844063432228,"h":0.01560737277117108,"c":1,"t":"Reading"},{"h":0.020738550584264326,"w":0.75933746337890617,"c":1,"t":"One such approach is called a Timber Stand Improvement (TSI) Cut. In a TSI Cut, really","y":0.086978332928318913,"x":0.1183832217728021},{"h":0.019779006862937432,"c":1,"t":"poor-quality tree and plant material is cut down to allow more space, light, and other","y":0.10706838395748108,"x":0.12032475963537545,"w":0.72245061238606767},{"w":0.7339805603027344,"t":"resources to the highest-valued stems that remain. Removing invasive plants might be","x":0.1184466129733579,"y":0.12645348825850744,"c":1,"h":0.017471745452405485},{"h":0.017579511838538675,"c":1,"t":"another primary goal of a TSI Cut. The stems that are left behind might then grow in","y":0.14534883709622759,"w":0.72038833618164066,"x":0.12038835608787669},{"c":1,"t":"size and develop more foliage and larger crowns or tops that produce more coverage for","x":0.11836598615317352,"y":0.16271996878142381,"w":0.75163136800130215,"h":0.020025549202321802},{"y":0.18161993784173358,"w":0.75922327677408863,"c":1,"x":0.12038836144075342,"h":0.019003115264797477,"t":"wildlife; they have a better chance to regenerate in a less crowded environment. TSI Cuts"},{"h":0.019792894262391059,"y":0.1996410650505771,"t":"can be tailored to one farmer's specific management goals for his or her land.","c":1,"x":0.11837682959657192,"w":0.66036870320638019},{"w":0.75728154500325529,"c":1,"x":0.11844660603291894,"t":"Another approach that might yield a high amount of low-use wood is a Salvage Cut. With","y":0.22959501532368276,"h":0.017498008038767332},{"h":0.018895348284474811,"c":1,"t":"the many pests and pathogens visiting forests including hemlock wooly adelgid, Asian","x":0.11844659715156411,"w":0.73009709676106771,"y":0.24854651190165711},{"c":1,"w":0.75339808146158838,"h":0.01904748934451661,"t":"longhorned beetle, emerald ash borer, and gypsy moth, to name just a few, it is important","x":0.11844659022892008,"y":0.26728971967872683},{"c":1,"t":"to remember that those working in the forests can help ease these issues through cutting","x":0.11844661684652484,"w":0.74174753824869799,"h":0.019043866570493506,"y":0.28473520268438923},{"t":"procedures. These types of cut reduce the number of sick trees and seek to manage the future","y":0.30423856105985814,"w":0.78455851236979168,"h":0.018665549613976484,"x":0.11840740268859254,"c":1},{"x":0.11838315601404058,"w":0.73410232543945309,"t":"spread of a pest problem. They leave vigorous trees that have stayed healthy enough to","y":0.3217686893307925,"h":0.020311822623850007,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017240638376396333,"y":0.3404177285380785,"w":0.18292043050130208,"t":"survive the outbreak.","x":0.11829007433724342},{"t":"A Shelterwood Cut, which only takes place in a mature forest that has already been thinned","y":0.37063953476843436,"w":0.79223302205403645,"c":1,"h":0.017522458941023,"x":0.10097086742063899},{"y":0.38919175520148586,"w":0.75157663981119782,"t":"several times, involves removing all the mature trees when other seedlings have become","h":0.01959169869110966,"c":1,"x":0.11838641775116571},{"w":0.75159734090169272,"h":0.019083135373124449,"y":0.40749057511064724,"x":0.11838096899401042,"c":1,"t":"established. This then allows the forester to decide which tree species are regenerated. It"},{"h":0.017534231619671603,"c":1,"t":"leaves a young forest where all trees are at a similar point in their growth. It can also be","x":0.11844660948370365,"w":0.74563105265299479,"y":0.42732558128070752},{"w":0.77669901529947916,"c":1,"t":"used to develop a two-tier forest so that there are two harvests and the money that comes in","x":0.11844660876059587,"h":0.017556872026199932,"y":0.44610591877971428},{"y":0.46235516276940436,"x":0.11831096900461935,"t":"is spread out over a decade or more.","w":0.31284052530924478,"h":0.020410384418808492,"c":1},{"x":0.11844660576267302,"w":0.70097086588541657,"y":0.49408099664658112,"c":1,"h":0.017546910437468033,"t":"Thinnings and dense and dead wood removal for fire prevention also center on the"},{"t":"production of low-use wood. However, it is important to remember that some retention of","x":0.11844659468698741,"h":0.017543287663444929,"y":0.5115264798863669,"w":0.76699030558268244,"c":1},{"h":0.017451822274941908,"y":0.53052325569735037,"c":1,"x":0.12038834566331975,"w":0.75533981323242183,"t":"what many would classify as low-use wood is very important. The tops of trees that have"},{"t":"been cut down should be left on the site so that their nutrients cycle back into the soil. In","w":0.75352762858072908,"x":0.11837825900433681,"y":0.54893074458303126,"h":0.018498877647138423,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"addition, trees with many cavities are extremely important habitats for insect predators like","y":0.56822429907639826,"h":0.017531514984796326,"w":0.77475728352864581,"x":0.11844660083236912},{"y":0.58720930221239975,"t":"woodpeckers, bats and small mammals. They help control problem insects and increase the","h":0.017463594953590511,"x":0.11844660874952126,"w":0.77669901529947916,"c":1},{"t":"health and resilience of the forest. It is also important to remember that not all small trees","x":0.11650485664308699,"y":0.60465116267359365,"h":0.017467217133424029,"w":0.76310679117838531,"c":1},{"t":"are low-use. For example, many species like hawthorn provide food for wildlife. Finally,","y":0.62306384890704047,"c":1,"x":0.11837843164869298,"w":0.75743433634440105,"h":0.020858004085742787},{"c":1,"x":0.11644827956562788,"t":"rare species of trees in a forest should also stay behind as they add to its structural diversity.","y":0.64194870092549206,"w":0.78653381347656259,"h":0.020117829224773565},{"x":0.87572815615268917,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"y":0.95494186050035101,"t":"21","w":0.029126211802164681}],"w":2400,"h":3209}